[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292105410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122326#issuecomment-5292105410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122326","id":5292105410,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO28ewg","user":{"login":"paulloz","id":437025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzAyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/437025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz","html_url":"https://github.com/paulloz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T10:08:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T10:08:32Z","body":"Hello, thanks for the report. Apparently it's not possible to have flags with values above `1 << 31`.  \n\nAccording to the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_%40globalscope.html#class-globalscope-constant-property-hint-flags):\n> Note: A flag value must be at least 1 and at most 2 ** 32 - 1.\n\nThis errors out on `F` in GDScript:\n```gdscript\n@export_flags(\"B:1\", \"C:2\", \"D:1024\", \"E:2147483648\", \"F:4294967296\") var foo\n```\n\nMaybe we should add a diagnostic to warn C# users in their IDE.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292105410/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]